1
00:00:07,733 --> 00:00:09,066
It's only been five days

2
00:00:09,100 --> 00:00:10,833
They're almost bigger than Lewes's

3
00:00:10,933 --> 00:00:11,566
Jason

4
00:00:11,566 --> 00:00:12,766
You're my hero

5
00:00:12,933 --> 00:00:13,733
When we make the money

6
00:00:13,833 --> 00:00:14,966
I'll give you a ten percent cut

7
00:00:14,966 --> 00:00:15,700
Boss

8
00:00:15,900 --> 00:00:16,566
I have an idea

9
00:00:16,866 --> 00:00:17,500
We can make even more

10
00:00:17,566 --> 00:00:18,000
Let's hear it

11
00:00:18,100 --> 00:00:19,333
We only have 20,000 frogs now

12
00:00:19,466 --> 00:00:21,066
Walter wants 50,000

13
00:00:21,066 --> 00:00:22,266
If we can get 50,000

14
00:00:22,266 --> 00:00:23,266
We could make millions more

15
00:00:23,266 --> 00:00:24,600
No use talking about it now

16
00:00:24,633 --> 00:00:25,433
It's all Lewes's fault

17
00:00:25,433 --> 00:00:26,666
If Lewes had lent me the money

18
00:00:26,666 --> 00:00:28,133
I would have bought more forest frog babies

19
00:00:28,266 --> 00:00:28,600
Boss

20
00:00:29,100 --> 00:00:30,300
It's not too late

21
00:00:30,633 --> 00:00:32,166
The bigger the forest frogs, the more they are worth

22
00:00:32,466 --> 00:00:34,500
We can buy some inferior forest frogs

23
00:00:34,500 --> 00:00:36,033
Feed them my secret feed for a few days

24
00:00:36,333 --> 00:00:37,266
Within ten days

25
00:00:37,433 --> 00:00:39,366
They'll be just as big as these

26
00:00:39,866 --> 00:00:40,733
Jason

27
00:00:40,733 --> 00:00:41,966
You're a genius

28
00:00:41,966 --> 00:00:43,266
I'll borrow money to buy more frogs now

29
00:00:43,500 --> 00:00:44,333
Daniel

30
00:00:44,333 --> 00:00:46,166
This is our only house

31
00:00:46,166 --> 00:00:47,300
We can't mortgage it

32
00:00:47,500 --> 00:00:48,366
Mom

33
00:00:48,433 --> 00:00:49,333
Just wait

34
00:00:49,333 --> 00:00:50,400
When I get rich

35
00:00:50,433 --> 00:00:51,666
I'll buy you a villa

36
00:01:12,333 --> 00:01:13,666
These frogs have recovered

37
00:01:13,866 --> 00:01:15,200
They're five grams heavier than before

38
00:01:15,633 --> 00:01:16,766
It won't affect the contract with Walter

39
00:01:17,866 --> 00:01:18,666
That's good

40
00:01:19,866 --> 00:01:20,733
Cynthia

41
00:01:20,866 --> 00:01:22,600
I want to build two more pools

42
00:01:22,900 --> 00:01:24,433
To give the frogs more space to grow

43
00:01:24,466 --> 00:01:25,866
Their quality will go up by ten percent

44
00:01:28,133 --> 00:01:29,233
We need more investment again

45
00:01:29,900 --> 00:01:30,766
Yeah

46
00:01:30,966 --> 00:01:31,900
Walter has high standards

47
00:01:32,066 --> 00:01:32,933
We have to do our best

48
00:01:34,766 --> 00:01:35,400
Then let's expand

49
00:01:35,533 --> 00:01:36,266
If we run out of money

50
00:01:36,300 --> 00:01:36,966
We'll figure it out together

51
00:01:39,700 --> 00:01:40,566
I don't know much about this

52
00:01:40,766 --> 00:01:41,666
But I trust you

53
00:01:42,133 --> 00:01:43,366
Go ahead and do what you want

54
00:01:52,066 --> 00:01:53,266
Let's all take a break

55
00:01:53,266 --> 00:01:54,266
Let's eat first

56
00:01:54,266 --> 00:01:55,333
Then back to work

57
00:01:55,633 --> 00:01:56,533
Coming, Mom
